          "file:src/simple_thinking_tool/guard.py",
          "file:src/simple_thinking_tool/hooks.py"
        ],
        "rationale": "Optional features that wrap around the core. config.py provides environment-driven configuration for all settings. auth.py handles bearer-token authentication for HTTP transport. guard.py implements the loop guard to prevent agent churn. hooks.py provides fire-and-forget background processing. All are off-by-default except config which is foundational."
