    "critical_paths": [
      "MCP Tool Call Path: server.py receives tool call → service.py fills template from modes.py/modes.json → guard.py checks loop state → store.py appends note with fsync → hooks.py fires background script (if enabled) → response returned to caller",
      "Mode Registration Path: modes.json (data definitions) → modes.py (load, validate, register) → server.py (expose as think_<mode> MCP tools) → definitions tool (catalog exposure to LLM)",
      "Configuration Foundation Path: config.py reads NUT_THINKING_* env vars → server.py uses config for transport/state/tokens → all other modules receive settings via server dispatch",
      "HTTP Auth Gate Path: auth.py validates bearer token → server.py admits request → actor identity derived from token → guard.py and store.py use actor for attribution and tracking",
      "Guard Enforcement Path: service.py calls guard.py before processing → guard.py checks same-mode block rule → guard.py checks consecutive count against warn_at/block_at thresholds → returns allow/warn/block decision → service.py proceeds or rejects",
      "Storage Rotation Path: store.py appends note → fsync → checks file size against NUT_THINKING_ROTATE_BYTES → if exceeded, rotates to new file → journal reads back from current or rotated files"
    ],
